  "published": "2025-03-30T17:47:27.063Z",
  "releaseNotes": "## Version 9.5.0 - March 30, 2025\n\n  - **Improved:** Document Viewer:\n    - **Added:** Better multi-platform suppport. Viewing some formats requires native dependencies which we already bundled\n      in our DLL for win-x64 and win-x86 platforms. In addition to these, we now also bundle dependencies for these platforms:\n      - win-arm64\n      - linux-x64, linux-arm64\n      - osx-x64, osx-arm64\n      Reference our NuGet package (not our DLL directly) especially if you are targeting linux-* and osx-*.\n    - **Fixed:** Error when converting/viewing Email formats (e.g. .msg files) containing images:\n      InvalidOperationException: The version of the native libSkiaSharp library (116.0) is incompatible with this version of SkiaSharp. Supported versions of the native libSkiaSharp library are in the range [88.1, 89.0).\n    - **Improved:** Stability and performance of Portable formats.\n\n  - **Improved:** Updated About dialog to display Runtime Identifier, e.g. win-x64.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "File manager control for integrating file browsing, upload & download features into your ASP.NET application or site (WebForms or MVC) rapidly.",
  "title": "ASP.NET File Manager and ASP.NET File Uploader",
  "verbatimVersion": "9.5.0",
